Package: termpremia
Title: Term Premium Decomposition from Zero-Coupon Yield Curves
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Mateusz", "Dadej", , "mateuszdadej@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates Gaussian affine term structure models and
    decomposes zero-coupon government bond yields into expected average
    future short rates and a term premium. Implements the three-step
    regression estimator of Adrian, Crump and Moench (2013), together with
    a model-free survey-based benchmark. Accepts any zero-coupon yield
    curve and reports term premia, risk-neutral yields, expected
    short-rate paths, expected excess returns and forward-rate
    decompositions.
